*Key Formulae:*
- Cauchy-Goursat Theorem: $integral_gamma f(z) d z = 0$ if $f$ is analytic inside and on $gamma$
- Cauchy's Integral Formula: $integral_gamma f(z) / (z - a) d z = 2 pi i f(a)$
